.TH WALLACE 1 "November 2026" "wallace 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wallace \- forensic token usage auditor and conversation browser for AGY, Claude, Grok, and Codex
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wallace
[\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-timeframe\fR \fISPEC\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR \fIPATH\fR] [\fB\-\-help\fR | \fB\-\-help\-all\fR | \fB\-\-version\fR]
.br
.B wallace browse
[\fICONVERSATION_ID\fR] [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-timeframe\fR \fISPEC\fR] [\fB\-\-source\fR \fBall\fR|\fBagy\fR|\fBclaude\fR|\fBgrok\fR|\fBcodex\fR] [\fB\-\-query\fR \fITEXT\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B wallace report
[\fBsummary\fR|\fBprojects\fR|\fBfeatures\fR|\fBconversations\fR|\fBmodels\fR|\fBsources\fR|\fBdaily\fR|\fBweekly\fR|\fBmonthly\fR|\fBinterval\fR]
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B wallace task
\fITASK_ID\fR [\fB\-\-project\fR \fISLUG\fR] [\fB\-\-conversation\fR \fIUUID\fR]... [\fB\-\-include\-qa\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR \fBtable\fR|\fBjson\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR \fIPATH\fR]
.br
.B wallace conversation
[\fBshow\fR|\fBread\fR|\fBlist\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B wallace query
\fICONVERSATION_ID\fR [\fB\-\-turns\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR \fIPATH\fR]
.br
.B wallace visidata
[\fBopen\fR|\fBconfig\fR|\fBinstall\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B wallace config
[\fBshow\fR|\fBinit\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR \fIPATH\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR]
.br
.B wallace metrics
[\fBexport\fR|\fBserve\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B wallace schema
[\fB\-\-list\fR | \fINAME\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR \fBjson\-schema\fR|\fBcsvw\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR \fIPATH\fR]
.br
.B wallace install
[\fB\-\-bin\-dir\fR \fIDIR\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Named after Oscar Wallace, the Treasury accountant who followed the ledger in
\fIThe Untouchables\fR, \fBwallace\fR audits Antigravity IDE
(\fI~/.gemini/antigravity\fR), Antigravity CLI (\fI~/.gemini/antigravity-cli\fR),
Claude Code (\fI~/.claude\fR), Grok CLI (\fI~/.grok\fR), and OpenAI Codex (\fI~/.codex\fR) session directories.
It resolves canonical \fI<PROJECT>\-WP\-<NN>\fR identifiers from git branches,
worker names, titles, and initial prompt briefs, aggregates exact or text-estimated
tokens alongside USD spend, and provides a minimalistic single-viewport TUI
conversation browser (\fBwallace browse\fR).
.PP
\fBwallace\fR integrates directly with \fBVisiData\fR (\fBvd\fR) via flat typed
JSONL streams, TSV/CSV tables, multi-sheet SQLite ledgers, and an installable
VisiData plugin defining currency formatting, sum aggregators, and quick
frequency shortcuts.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B report summary|projects|features|conversations|models|sources|daily|weekly|monthly|interval
Aggregate token usage and USD spend across projects, features, and timeframes.
Limit the audit window with \fB\-t\fR/\fB\-\-timeframe\fR (\fBtoday\fR,
\fByesterday\fR, \fB"last 7 days"\fR, \fB7d\fR, \fB24h\fR, \fBthis\-week\fR,
\fBlast\-week\fR, \fBthis\-month\fR, \fBlast\-month\fR, \fB2026\-W46\fR, or
\fBYYYY\-MM\-DD..YYYY\-MM\-DD\fR). Combine any report verb with
\fB\-\-period day|week|month|interval\fR and \fB\-\-interval\fR.
.TP
.B task \fITASK_ID\fR
Aggregate all conversations matching \fITASK_ID\fR (including project-scoped
bare \fIWP\-NN\fR fallbacks, explicit \fB\-\-conversation\fR UUIDs, optional
\fB\-t\fR/\fB\-\-timeframe\fR bounds, and optional prorated QA attribution via
\fB\-\-include\-qa\fR) as an aligned table or Draft 2020-12 JSON
(\fItask\-usage.schema.json\fR).
.TP
.B browse [\fICONVERSATION_ID\fR]
Launch the minimalistic interactive \fBcurses\fR conversation browser across
All, AGY, Claude, Grok, and Codex sessions. Press \fBt\fR in list view to cycle
timeframe windows (\fBall\fR, \fBtoday\fR, \fByesterday\fR, \fB7d\fR, \fB30d\fR,
\fBthis\-month\fR, \fBlast\-month\fR). Requires an interactive TTY.
.TP
.B conversation show|read|list
\fBshow\fR returns self, subagent, and combined token/cost JSON; \fBread\fR
renders chronological messages as plain text or Draft 2020-12 JSON
(\fIconversation\-messages.schema.json\fR); \fBlist\fR prints the conversation table.
.TP
.B visidata open|config|install
Launch VisiData with a multi-sheet Wallace SQLite workbook (or specific sheet),
print the Wallace VisiData plugin snippet, or install it into \fI~/.visidata/\fR.
.TP
.B config show|init
Print active configuration or write an editable default TOML pricing config.
.TP
.B metrics export|serve
Emit Prometheus exposition metrics or run an HTTP \fI/metrics\fR exporter.
.TP
.B schema
List or emit JSON Schema Draft 2020-12 and W3C CSVW data-interchange contracts
(\fBtoken\-report\fR, \fBledger\-row\fR, \fBconversation\-usage\fR,
\fBtask\-usage\fR, and \fBconversation\-messages\fR).
.TP
.B install
Install an executable \fBwallace\fR launcher shim into \fB\-\-bin\-dir\fR or
\fI${WALLACE_BIN_DIR:\-~/.local/bin}/wallace\fR.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B WALLACE_CONFIG
Path to TOML configuration file (default: \fI~/.config/wallace/config.toml\fR).
.TP
.B WALLACE_IDE_DIR, WALLACE_CLI_DIR, WALLACE_CLAUDE_DIR, WALLACE_GROK_DIR, WALLACE_CODEX_DIR, WALLACE_BRAIN_DIRS
Override Antigravity IDE, Antigravity CLI, Claude, Grok, Codex, and standalone brain directories.
.TP
.B WALLACE_BIN_DIR
Override target directory for \fBwallace install\fR (default: \fI~/.local/bin\fR).
.TP
.B WALLACE_METRICS_HOST, WALLACE_METRICS_PORT
Override bind address and TCP port for \fBwallace metrics serve\fR.
.TP
.B WALLACE_NOW
Optional ISO-8601 reference timestamp pinning relative timeframe calculations
(\fByesterday\fR, \fBlast 7 days\fR, etc.) for reproducible scripts.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Runtime, lookup, validation, or file error.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid CLI argument or flag.
